---
/**
 * Docs home (issue #7). Landing chrome for the shell; substantive
 * documentation pages live under shared Markdown/MDX sources.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/base";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Home"
  description="Documentation for the Augur Design System: shared design guidance, generated tokens, semantic themes, and reusable React components."
>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1 class="augur-type-display">Augur Design System</h1>
    <p>
      A shared interface language for Augur: maintained design guidance,
      generated tokens, semantic light/dark themes, and reusable React
      components — one canonical source for products, the public site, and
      the agents that build them.
    </p>
    <div class="status-note augur-type-ui">
      Early development. The foundation is real and consumable today:
      generated tokens, semantic themes, and self-hosted fonts ship from
      the <code>@augur/design-system</code> workspace package. The first
      components — Button and Card — are implemented and documented; the
      rest of the starter set has not landed, and nothing on this site
      fakes them.
    </div>
    <p>
      The rendered pages and their clean Markdown sources come from the
      same files; every value the system adopts is recorded in
      <a href="https://github.com/jubalm/augur-design-system/blob/main/DESIGN.md">DESIGN.md</a>
      and the foundation decision record.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="card-grid">
    <li>
      <a class="card" href={withBase("/getting-started")}>
        <h2>Getting started</h2>
        <p>Consume the package from a workspace app: stylesheet entry, fonts, and today's public exports.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="card" href={withBase("/foundations/decisions")}>
        <h2>Foundation decisions</h2>
        <p>The audit and review record behind the foundation — what is adopted and what is still a proposal.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="card" href={withBase("/foundations/fonts")}>
        <h2>Fonts and typography</h2>
        <p>Two voice families, seven typography roles, self-hosted delivery — rendered live from the package.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="card" href={withBase("/foundations/theming")}>
        <h2>Theming</h2>
        <p>One system, two equal everyday themes. Semantic roles, system preference, and scoped subtrees.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="card" href={withBase("/reference/package-entries")}>
        <h2>Package entries</h2>
        <p>The three public entry points of @augur/design-system — module constants and stylesheets.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
